/.documents-personal-ai-keys.json
/private/

# Agent session configuration. The repository is public: allow the shared
# permission grant and nothing else under `.claude/`, so a personal override or
# a stray transcript can never be committed by accident.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
# Delivery-protocol skills are product of the repository, not personal
# configuration: they are reviewed, versioned and invocable by any session.
# The blanket ignore above still covers settings.local.json and transcripts.
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/skills/**
# Edit-time invariant warnings are likewise shared tooling, and settings.json
# above references them: an ignored hook would be a dangling path in every
# other checkout.
!/.claude/hooks/
!/.claude/hooks/**
